    <main class="w-full">
      <div id="content" class="container opacity-0"><section data-section-type="text_and_single_image" data-section-id="pg110_sec001" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl overflow-hidden bg-[#d8f1f2] px-8 pt-8 pb-0 max-sm:px-5 max-sm:pt-5"><div class="flex items-start gap-0 max-sm:items-stretch max-sm:flex-col"><div aria-hidden="true" class="flex w-36 shrink-0 flex-col items-center justify-center self-stretch rounded-tl-[1.75rem] rounded-br-[1.75rem] bg-[#a568ad] px-6 py-7 text-white max-sm:w-full max-sm:self-auto max-sm:rounded-[1.75rem] max-sm:py-5"><div class="relative h-12 w-20"><div class="absolute left-3 top-0 h-6 w-6 rotate-[-25deg] rounded-full border-2 border-white"></div><div class="absolute left-6 top-1 h-4 w-px rotate-[-25deg] bg-white"></div><div class="absolute left-15 top-9 h-3 w-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white border-t-0"></div><div class="absolute left-8 top-8 h-3 w-5 rounded-full border-2 border-white border-r-0 border-t-0"></div><div class="absolute left-3 top-10 h-5 w-2 rotate-[-25deg] rounded-full bg-white"></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col pt-4 max-sm:pt-3"><div class="bg-[#a568ad] px-4 py-3 text-white"><h1 class="adt-h1 font-bold" data-id="pg110_n0003">Mjedisi i vendit tim</h1></div><div class="border-b-4 border-[#a568ad] px-4 py-4"><h2 class="adt-h2 font-medium text-[#222222]" data-id="pg110_n0004">Njeriu mbron natyr&#xeb;n</h2></div></div></div><div class="pt-10 text-left text-[#222222] max-sm:pt-8"><p class="adt-body mb-6 leading-relaxed"><span data-id="pg110_n0006">Era po shfletonte fjalorin e gjuh&#xeb;s shqipe dhe po shikonte se sa fjal&#xeb; i njihte.</span> <span data-id="pg110_n0007">U befasua kur pa nj&#xeb; prej p&#xeb;rkufizimeve p&#xeb;r natyr&#xeb;n: &#x201c;Natyra &#xeb;sht&#xeb; mjedisi n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cilin rron njeriu n&#xeb; Tok&#xeb;, me t&#xeb; gjitha qeniet e gjalla dhe sendet pa jet&#xeb;&#x201d;.</span> <span data-id="pg110_n0008">Ndaloi t&#xeb; reflektonte: si mundet njeriu t&#xeb; d&#xeb;mtoj&#xeb; jo vet&#xeb;m mjedisin q&#xeb; e rrethon, por edhe mjedisin ku jetojn&#xeb; edhe gjallesat e tjera.</span></p><p class="adt-body mb-6 leading-relaxed"><span data-id="pg110_n0010">- Sa keq b&#xeb;jm&#xeb; kur e ndotim rrug&#xeb;n, pyjet e detin, - shtoi Era, me z&#xeb; t&#xeb; lart&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg110_n0011">- Ja, p&#xeb;r shembull, kur hedhim mbeturina n&#xeb; det apo breg, ne p&#xeb;rve&#xe7;q&#xeb; e ndotim nj&#xeb; peizazh aq mahnit&#xeb;s, edhe shkat&#xeb;rrojm&#xeb; jet&#xeb;n e shum&#xeb; gjallesave t&#xeb; detit.</span> <span data-id="pg110_n0012">Pse i b&#xeb;jm&#xeb; k&#xeb;to veprime ne njer&#xeb;zit?</span> <span data-id="pg110_n0013">Pse duhet t&#xeb; hedhim mbeturina n&#xeb; tok&#xeb;, n&#xeb; vend q&#xeb; t&#x2019;i mbajm&#xeb; ato dhe t&#x2019;i hedhim n&#xeb; shport&#xeb;n e mbeturinave?</span> <span data-id="pg110_n0014">Pse t&#xeb; mos mbjellim drur&#xeb; p&#xeb;r gjelb&#xeb;rimin e mjedisit, por i presim ata?</span> <span data-id="pg110_n0015">Sa kushton t&#xeb; hedhim shishet e plastik&#xeb;s n&#xeb; shport&#xeb;n p&#xeb;r riciklim?</span></p><p class="adt-body mb-5 leading-relaxed max-sm:mb-4"><span data-id="pg110_n0017">Dua t&#xeb; b&#xeb;j nj&#xeb; prezantim p&#xeb;r mbrojtjen e natyr&#xeb;s para shoqeve dhe shok&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; klas&#xeb;s, - mendoi Era, e shqet&#xeb;suar p&#xeb;r gjendjen e natyr&#xeb;s n&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb;.</span></p></div><div class="-mx-8 mt-0 max-sm:-mx-5"><img data-id="pg110_im001" src="images/pg110_im001.png" alt="Vajza e ulur n&#xeb; stol lexon nj&#xeb; lib&#xeb;r n&#xeb; park, nd&#xeb;rsa pran&#xeb; saj nj&#xeb; burr&#xeb; sh&#xeb;tit qenin mes pem&#xeb;ve." class="block h-auto w-full object-cover object-top"></div></section></div>
